cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Spa-Bench, please cite the accompanying MSc thesis and this repository."
title: "Spa-Bench: A Real-Robot Benchmark for Scene-Grounded Compositional Transfer in Vision-Language-Action Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tien-Smith"
    given-names: "Justin"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-08
abstract: >-
  Spa-Bench evaluates scene-grounded semantic and compositional transfer in
  vision-language-action policies using an SO-101 robot, controlled missing-cell
  fine-tuning data, and matched physical evaluation scenes.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - vision-language-action models
  - compositional generalization
  - real-robot evaluation
  - LeRobot

